easy-macchiato-blue
===================

This project is a modified Fcitx5 theme derived from:

  Catppuccin for Fcitx5
  https://github.com/catppuccin/fcitx5

  Specifically based on the "Catppuccin Macchiato Blue" flavour/accent
  (src/catppuccin-macchiato-blue).

Upstream license: MIT License
Upstream copyright: Copyright (c) 2021 Catppuccin

Upstream theme authors (retained in theme.conf Author field):
  - justTOBBI   https://github.com/justTOBBI
  - Isabelinc   https://github.com/isabelincorp
  - Kurome      https://github.com/kuromedayo

Catppuccin palette and branding belong to the Catppuccin organization.
This repository is an independent derivative and is not an official
Catppuccin project.

Modifications in this derivative include (non-exhaustive):
  - Layout / margin tuning for candidate and menu panels
  - Preedit (HighlightBackgroundColor) contrast adjustment
  - Menu highlight accent unified to Macchiato Blue
  - LabelTextSizeFactor for candidate index hierarchy
  - Fonts left to classicui.conf (system / user font settings)
  - Metadata renamed to Easy Macchiato Blue

Rounded panel/highlight SVG assets and menu icons (panel.svg, highlight.svg,
radio.png, arrow.png) originate from the upstream Catppuccin Fcitx5 theme
package (rounded-corner assets).
